{"2736270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primage", "steam_appid": 2736270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primage – a unique blend of survival, RPG, and strategic management</strong></h2>Explore a procedurally generated world set in the Stone Age. Develop your settlement, craft tools, fight for survival, and shape your character in a world full of challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game World</strong></h2>– Infinite, procedurally generated terrain with diverse biomes: forests, swamps, deserts, mountains, caves, and water areas  <br>– Dynamic day and night cycle  <br>– Changing weather: rain, storms, fog  <br>– Four seasons affecting conditions and resource availability<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong></h2>– Hunger and exhaustion affecting regeneration speed and action efficiency  <br>– Acquiring food through hunting, gathering, and farming  <br>– Crafting tools and weapons from basic materials<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and Hunting</strong></h2>– Over 20 animal species: land, aquatic, flying, and venomous  <br>– 10 types of weapons and tools  <br>– Tracking, skinning, and realistic animal behaviors  <br>– Combat based on dodging, heavy attacks, and throwing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Development</strong></h2>– Point-based ability unlocking system  <br>– Skills affecting survival, combat, gathering, and tracking  <br>– Active and passive abilities triggered by context<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settlement Management</strong></h2>– Over 30 types of structures: shelters, workstations, storage buildings, furniture  <br>– Settlers perform tasks: gathering, building, defending, hunting  <br>– Satisfaction system influencing population growth  <br>– Reputation and relations with other settlements  <br>– Task automation through gathering and construction zones<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access is just the beginning</strong></h2>Primage is a long-term project developed in stages. The release version offers a solid foundation, and upcoming updates will introduce new systems, content, and improvements.<br><br>Thank you for your interest and for helping shape the future of the game.<br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primage – a unique blend of survival, RPG, and strategic management</strong></h2>Explore a procedurally generated world set in the Stone Age. Develop your settlement, craft tools, fight for survival, and shape your character in a world full of challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game World</strong></h2>– Infinite, procedurally generated terrain with diverse biomes: forests, swamps, deserts, mountains, caves, and water areas  <br>– Dynamic day and night cycle  <br>– Changing weather: rain, storms, fog  <br>– Four seasons affecting conditions and resource availability<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong></h2>– Hunger and exhaustion affecting regeneration speed and action efficiency  <br>– Acquiring food through hunting, gathering, and farming  <br>– Crafting tools and weapons from basic materials<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and Hunting</strong></h2>– Over 20 animal species: land, aquatic, flying, and venomous  <br>– 10 types of weapons and tools  <br>– Tracking, skinning, and realistic animal behaviors  <br>– Combat based on dodging, heavy attacks, and throwing<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Development</strong></h2>– Point-based ability unlocking system  <br>– Skills affecting survival, combat, gathering, and tracking  <br>– Active and passive abilities triggered by context<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settlement Management</strong></h2>– Over 30 types of structures: shelters, workstations, storage buildings, furniture  <br>– Settlers perform tasks: gathering, building, defending, hunting  <br>– Satisfaction system influencing population growth  <br>– Reputation and relations with other settlements  <br>– Task automation through gathering and construction zones<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access is just the beginning</strong></h2>Primage is a long-term project developed in stages. The release version offers a solid foundation, and upcoming updates will introduce new systems, content, and improvements.<br><br>Thank you for your interest and for helping shape the future of the game.<br>", "short_description": "As the leader of a Stone Age tribe, gather resources, develop your settlement and lead your people through the challenges of a world full of danger and mystery. Your survival skills, strategic planning and decision-making will be key in this battle for survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736270/74f64877b9848446c8e9e739a04d1b429ecbee0f/header.jpg?t=1784051528", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736270/cc7b3bb87afe42e6d0a12ba6c5b9bd6e10233749/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784051528", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736270/cc7b3bb87afe42e6d0a12ba6c5b9bd6e10233749/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784051528", "website": "https://fadzior.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><stro